WEBVTT

00:00.570 --> 00:06.620
<i>Unbeknownst to Misumi Makoto as he 
was on the road to Rotsgard Academy,</i>

00:06.620 --> 00:10.130
<i>the two heroes were on the field of battle.</i>

00:10.130 --> 00:12.570
The hero has returned!

00:12.920 --> 00:15.540
Welcome back, Hero.

00:16.530 --> 00:18.000
I'm back, Lily.

00:18.700 --> 00:21.420
That was another fine 
display of martial skill.

00:22.090 --> 00:25.490
We should be able to reclaim 
Fort Stella from the demons soon.

00:26.300 --> 00:29.410
We'll be fighting alongside 
the Limia Army next, right?

00:30.300 --> 00:32.380
So I'll finally get to meet their hero.

00:32.760 --> 00:37.070
Oh, you're interested in Limia's hero?

00:37.070 --> 00:39.300
I've heard she's quite beautiful.

00:39.300 --> 00:44.090
Don't worry. I'm more than 
happy with you and the others.

00:49.200 --> 00:50.980
So that's Fort Stella.

00:52.250 --> 00:54.700
The war is finally beginning.

01:20.050 --> 01:22.600
<b>Season Two</b>

02:27.120 --> 02:31.460
<b>Night Three    Stellar Wars</b>

02:27.120 --> 02:31.460
<b>Night Three    Stellar Wars</b>

02:28.520 --> 02:30.070
A dinner party, huh?

02:30.720 --> 02:35.480
I imagine we'll also be conducting final 
checks for the battle to reclaim Fort Stella.

02:35.480 --> 02:38.210
We've already secured the 
route to the fortress.

02:38.210 --> 02:40.550
It will be like a pre-battle pep rally.

02:41.250 --> 02:45.730
Apparently Gritonia's hero will make a 
statement before the battle commences.

02:45.730 --> 02:49.300
A statement requesting the 
goddess's blessing, huh?

02:49.710 --> 02:52.420
When fighting against demi-humans or demons,

02:52.420 --> 02:55.280
hyumans unconditionally receive 
the goddess's blessing.

02:55.970 --> 02:58.310
We have a great advantage.

03:00.190 --> 03:02.010
You don't look happy.

03:02.010 --> 03:04.270
Are you curious about the empire's hero?

03:04.270 --> 03:06.200
There's that, too.

03:06.520 --> 03:11.070
I heard we came from the same 
world and are close in age.

03:12.380 --> 03:15.290
Welcome, Hero of Limia and her retinue.

03:15.890 --> 03:20.620
We are honored to receive your invitation,
 Your Majesty Queen Lily.

03:26.690 --> 03:30.680
As you just heard, there are no 
major changes to the battle plan.

03:31.370 --> 03:35.510
We've received the expected relief supplies 
and reinforcements from the King of Aion.

03:35.510 --> 03:39.040
From Laurel, we received less than expected.

03:39.040 --> 03:43.350
I'm sure the people of Limia 
know precisely the reason.

03:44.180 --> 03:48.200
<i>It's because of the friction 
between our nations over Chiya.</i>

03:48.490 --> 03:52.740
However, our forces have quintuple 
the strength of the demons.

03:52.740 --> 03:55.280
Furthermore, once the goddess's 
blessing is requested,

03:55.280 --> 03:57.610
our advantage will be unshakable.

03:57.610 --> 03:59.950
Any other questions?

04:00.300 --> 04:05.270
May I ask why we chose to fight at night?

04:05.710 --> 04:08.130
Because we're accustomed 
to fighting at night.

04:08.560 --> 04:10.130
Oh?

04:10.130 --> 04:12.310
How encouraging.

04:12.310 --> 04:16.090
We have little experience fighting at night.

04:16.090 --> 04:18.330
Any strategies or information from Limia?

04:18.330 --> 04:20.640
None. We have nothing to offer.

04:21.070 --> 04:23.920
Well, this is just a mid-boss battle.

04:23.920 --> 04:28.770
The goddess's blessing will buff 
us and debuff the demons.

04:28.770 --> 04:29.620
It should be an easy win.

04:29.620 --> 04:32.070
Buff? Debuff?

04:32.070 --> 04:36.450
Let's reclaim the fortress quickly and 
receive words of praise from the goddess.

04:36.960 --> 04:39.660
And for today, let's not stand on ceremony.

04:40.960 --> 04:44.900
By the way, Tomoki-kun, did we 
ever meet in the other world?

04:44.900 --> 04:45.740
No.

04:45.740 --> 04:47.610
But I'm sure I recognize you from somewhere.

04:47.680 --> 04:49.560
<b>Fall and Winter Trends This Year
Traditional Casual Style</b>

04:48.740 --> 04:51.350
Oh, I remember now.

04:51.350 --> 04:54.420
The model my friend liked had the same name.

04:55.770 --> 04:58.850
We're two different, 
totally unrelated people.

04:58.850 --> 05:02.030
You're right. I probably 
just mistook you for him.

05:02.030 --> 05:04.080
I'm sorry if I upset you.

05:04.330 --> 05:07.550
What? I didn't say I was upset.

05:07.550 --> 05:09.560
Do I look upset to you?

05:09.560 --> 05:11.800
That's not what I...

05:12.280 --> 05:15.270
Hibiki-san, what's your level right now?

05:15.270 --> 05:18.590
Me? 430.

05:18.590 --> 05:20.120
I'm 605.

05:20.450 --> 05:22.600
<i>He's suddenly one-upping me.</i>

05:22.840 --> 05:26.560
Wow, you've accomplished so much.

05:26.560 --> 05:27.040
I have.

05:27.860 --> 05:30.360
So could you stop calling me Tomoki-kun?

05:30.880 --> 05:34.170
Tomoki-sama might be a bit too much, 
but at least call me Tomoki-san.

05:34.650 --> 05:36.930
<i>Who said we wouldn't stand on ceremony?</i>

05:36.930 --> 05:41.440
S-Sorry. I'll be careful from now on.

05:41.440 --> 05:43.200
Also, mind if I speak casually?

05:43.200 --> 05:44.690
I'm no good with polite language.

05:45.150 --> 05:46.990
Go right ahead.

05:47.610 --> 05:50.330
<i>That was his idea of speaking politely?</i>

05:50.330 --> 05:53.950
<i>If this were a formal interview, 
he wouldn't have made the cut.</i>

06:00.710 --> 06:03.180
What's the matter? Can't sleep?

06:03.180 --> 06:04.300
Naval...

06:06.170 --> 06:08.920
I was just thinking about 
what a large operation this is.

06:10.270 --> 06:15.520
I've never asked, but why 
did you come to this world?

06:16.480 --> 06:20.740
In my old world, I was 
born to a good family.

06:20.740 --> 06:24.710
I was blessed with fortunate circumstances 
and could do anything with a little effort.

06:24.710 --> 06:25.870
Impressive, right?

06:25.870 --> 06:26.680
I see.

06:26.930 --> 06:29.570
Did you just think I'm kind of bitch?

06:29.570 --> 06:31.500
No, I know you are.

06:31.500 --> 06:33.410
At least deny it a little.

06:34.350 --> 06:36.020
I'm joking.

06:36.710 --> 06:40.020
Anyway, I'm surprised 
you're going off to war.

06:40.790 --> 06:44.650
I remember the fancy young lady who cried 
because she couldn't kill a single kobold.

06:44.650 --> 06:47.550
That was the first time in my 
life that I'd failed like that.

06:48.480 --> 06:52.300
This has been my first time meeting 
someone I trust to watch my back, too.

06:55.600 --> 06:59.590
I'll probably face more struggles 
and difficulties going forward.

06:59.590 --> 07:03.550
But I don't regret coming to this world.

07:03.550 --> 07:04.600
Hibiki...

07:04.600 --> 07:06.960
Come on. We'd better get to bed.

07:06.960 --> 07:09.120
There's a war starting.

07:09.880 --> 07:10.690
Right.

07:17.660 --> 07:21.940
O Gracious Goddess, behold our holy war.

07:22.350 --> 07:24.750
The two lights you granted this world

07:24.750 --> 07:28.290
have gathered here with these brave 
soldiers to request your blessing.

07:29.220 --> 07:33.040
O Merciful Goddess, 
grant the kindness of destruction

07:33.040 --> 07:35.470
to these base demons who harm your people.

07:35.470 --> 07:38.210
Grant your protection 
to those who serve you.

07:42.020 --> 07:43.650
I have a report for Rona-sama.

07:44.210 --> 07:48.480
We've identified Limia and Gritonia's 
troop placement and marching route.

07:48.480 --> 07:53.250
They just issued a request to receive the 
goddess's blessing and have begun marching.

07:53.570 --> 07:55.560
We expected all of this.

07:56.760 --> 08:00.070
I'm going to battle. Notify Io.

08:03.040 --> 08:05.040
An impregnable fortress, huh?

08:05.350 --> 08:08.220
It's a steep slope, but we'll have 
to overwhelm them with our numbers.

08:08.220 --> 08:10.750
Watch out for traps laid by the demons.

08:11.150 --> 08:14.720
Many of my friends sleep beneath this road.

08:15.230 --> 08:17.220
Many knights were slain, too.

08:21.150 --> 08:23.010
Do not quail! Advance!

08:23.010 --> 08:26.180
We have the goddess's protection!

08:38.860 --> 08:39.610
That's odd.

08:40.360 --> 08:42.480
They should be putting up more of a fight.

08:42.480 --> 08:47.080
You're right. I've heard we've never 
even made it to the fortress until now.

08:47.700 --> 08:52.270
Woody-san and Chiya-chan, 
raise a defensive barrier just in case.

08:52.270 --> 08:55.790
Also, prepare a floating ritual 
for high-speed travel.

08:55.790 --> 08:57.870
The gates are opening!

08:56.390 --> 08:57.730
Go!

08:57.240 --> 08:58.760
Capture Stella!

08:59.380 --> 09:03.380
Rona-sama, both targets have 
entered activation range.

09:03.590 --> 09:07.350
Time to see how strong the heroes are.

09:08.160 --> 09:09.270
What's this?

09:11.320 --> 09:12.530
A magic circle!

09:12.530 --> 09:14.860
But it's so big...

09:14.860 --> 09:16.860
Everyone, prepare for attack!

09:21.730 --> 09:23.010
Woody-san!

09:23.910 --> 09:24.760
Got it.

09:28.640 --> 09:31.090
Damn! A demon trap.

09:32.220 --> 09:34.040
So that's the empire's hero.

09:34.350 --> 09:36.460
Are those shoes allowing him to float?

09:39.570 --> 09:40.840
Divine Spear!

09:45.570 --> 09:47.400
He's no fun.

09:49.380 --> 09:50.730
Did they all fall?

09:51.570 --> 09:55.620
Took you long enough to notice!

09:57.010 --> 09:59.710
These replica silver shoes aren't perfect.

09:59.710 --> 10:01.810
They're gonna make me fall 
when I carry something heavy!

10:01.810 --> 10:03.350
It's my equipment that's heavy!

10:03.350 --> 10:04.700
Don't fight.

10:04.700 --> 10:07.340
You're both heavier than me.

10:07.340 --> 10:08.900
Of course we are!

10:09.430 --> 10:10.980
Begin the counterattack.

10:10.980 --> 10:13.150
Mora, summon Nagi.

10:13.150 --> 10:13.870
Got it.

10:18.190 --> 10:19.340
A dragon.

10:22.330 --> 10:26.160
You'll pay for doing that when 
you're only a mid-boss!

10:28.410 --> 10:31.490
Their firepower is as threatening 
as the rumors say.

10:31.850 --> 10:34.950
But they cannot take this fortress.

10:36.940 --> 10:39.340
Mora and Yukinatsu, 
provide support from the rear.

10:39.340 --> 10:40.820
Ginebia, let's go!

10:40.820 --> 10:41.740
Right!

10:47.460 --> 10:49.250
So you're the hero.

10:49.250 --> 10:52.170
Is this the mid-boss we've been waiting for?

10:50.630 --> 10:51.720
Tomoki!

10:54.850 --> 10:58.790
You won't even state your name?
 What a boorish hero.

10:59.020 --> 11:02.590
Manners don't matter on the battlefield!

11:08.700 --> 11:11.020
I suppose you wouldn't go down in one hit.

11:11.020 --> 11:13.470
But I'm not the only one you're fighting.

11:17.140 --> 11:18.450
Did you wait long?

11:19.780 --> 11:22.390
I apologize if my companion was rude to you.

11:22.390 --> 11:23.990
Hey, what does that mean?

11:23.990 --> 11:27.100
It's fine. He's a truly hyuman hero.

11:27.100 --> 11:30.490
I'm the Hero of the 
Limia Kingdom, Otonashi Hibiki.

11:30.810 --> 11:35.340
I am Third Brigade General of the Demon 
King's forces, Io the demigigant.

11:39.530 --> 11:41.480
His regeneration rivals 
that of the Black Spider.

11:41.830 --> 11:43.680
I'm up against two heroes.

11:43.680 --> 11:46.280
I'll be using some secret stratagems, too.

11:47.890 --> 11:50.190
Take this power of the damnable goddess,

11:50.190 --> 11:53.390
this rampant absurdity, 
and these arrogant fools,

11:53.700 --> 11:55.640
and shatter them to pieces.

12:04.020 --> 12:05.040
What's happening?

12:06.210 --> 12:07.040
Tomoki?

12:07.640 --> 12:10.490
I feel weak.

12:11.280 --> 12:12.830
What did you do?

12:13.230 --> 12:18.800
Within a limited area, I removed the 
blessing you received from the goddess.

12:19.180 --> 12:23.020
What? The goddess's power vanished?

12:24.270 --> 12:27.610
I shall make you immortal at night.

12:29.750 --> 12:33.470
<i>If I'm hit by an attack now, I'll die?!</i>

12:35.190 --> 12:36.440
Let's retreat.

12:36.440 --> 12:36.980
What?

12:37.540 --> 12:39.710
We're at a disadvantage.

12:39.710 --> 12:40.900
We're turning around.

12:40.900 --> 12:41.450
But...

12:41.450 --> 12:43.730
Shut up! Do as you're told!

12:44.510 --> 12:46.700
We made it to their commander, 
and we're fleeing?

12:47.230 --> 12:49.020
You should retreat, too.

12:49.400 --> 12:53.430
We're heroes. We can't fall here.

12:53.970 --> 12:56.380
We can reorganize our forces and come back!

12:57.040 --> 12:59.330
Maybe you're right.

13:02.550 --> 13:05.040
But only caring about saving your own skin?

13:05.710 --> 13:08.500
I'll never call someone like that a hero.

13:08.820 --> 13:10.260
Oh, yeah?

13:12.240 --> 13:14.650
I wasn't expecting him to flee.

13:14.650 --> 13:19.470
I'm disappointed. I didn't think 
I'd only be fighting one of you.

13:19.890 --> 13:21.940
I'm not alone.

13:22.210 --> 13:25.100
We oversaw the retreat 
of the remaining forces.

13:25.100 --> 13:26.900
And took care of the rank 
and file in the area.

13:28.320 --> 13:31.880
I see. Then allow me to 
confirm the hero's power.

13:32.160 --> 13:34.320
Not with words, but with our skills.

13:36.530 --> 13:40.420
What's this? They've turned 
the tables on my hyumans.

13:40.420 --> 13:43.910
After I sent them two heroes, too.

13:44.510 --> 13:46.760
Huh? I can't believe he's here.

13:48.110 --> 13:49.710
I found you.

13:56.120 --> 13:59.810
It's morning already? 
You've held on for quite a long time.

14:04.870 --> 14:07.190
Not bad. That reached the bone.

14:08.360 --> 14:09.070
It's stuck!

14:15.540 --> 14:18.970
So you released your sword 
and erected a barrier.

14:23.940 --> 14:25.140
<i>I can't do it.</i>

14:25.490 --> 14:29.100
<i>I'm not nearly strong enough.</i>

14:31.250 --> 14:33.720
<i>How are things over there, Sofia?</i>

14:33.720 --> 14:35.010
<i>They're going smoothly.</i>

14:35.010 --> 14:37.700
<i>I'm so eager to fight, I can't stand it.</i>

14:38.890 --> 14:40.130
Sofia, look.

14:40.400 --> 14:42.260
What?

14:44.010 --> 14:45.070
Is that...

14:45.370 --> 14:46.570
Could it be...

14:47.390 --> 14:49.150
The goddess's power?

14:50.450 --> 14:54.210
<i>If that's the goddess' light, 
then we still have hope.</i>

14:54.210 --> 14:54.960
Everyone!

14:55.190 --> 14:57.150
We'll struggle a little longer!

14:57.150 --> 14:57.920
Yeah!

15:12.470 --> 15:16.630
You're barely standing with 
the help of support spells.

15:17.310 --> 15:19.320
We won't give up.

15:19.320 --> 15:21.820
That's our greatest weapon!

15:23.690 --> 15:24.770
<i>Woody.</i>

15:24.770 --> 15:26.170
<i>The magic device.</i>

15:27.280 --> 15:31.100
<i>For Limia's sake, we cannot lose Hibiki.</i>

15:31.100 --> 15:33.480
<i>Not you, Verda, or Chiya, either.</i>

15:34.130 --> 15:35.570
<i>B-But...</i>

15:35.930 --> 15:41.230
<i>Please. Let me save Hibiki 
and our companions.</i>

15:43.800 --> 15:46.410
<i>That's not fair.</i>

15:47.510 --> 15:48.370
I'm falling back a bit.

15:48.620 --> 15:50.750
Verda, watch Hibiki.

15:50.750 --> 15:52.090
What? Hey!

15:52.840 --> 15:55.440
You're a real ogre, you know that?

15:59.860 --> 16:03.680
Chiya, provide Naval with 
powerful support magic.

16:03.680 --> 16:04.190
Got it.

16:08.710 --> 16:10.370
The Rose Sign, as well.

16:16.430 --> 16:17.580
I'm starting.

16:18.930 --> 16:20.530
Don't make that face.

16:23.000 --> 16:24.020
I go.

16:24.490 --> 16:27.810
It's beautiful. Is this the 
effect of the magic device?

16:29.630 --> 16:30.480
Yes.

16:33.290 --> 16:34.310
Verda-kun!

16:35.440 --> 16:39.210
Your defense is decent, 
but your sword skills need work.

16:39.730 --> 16:41.180
Stand back, Verda!

16:44.900 --> 16:47.100
What?

16:47.800 --> 16:49.060
I can cut him.

16:49.060 --> 16:51.990
Naval, what kind of spell is that?

16:54.530 --> 16:57.210
I used a special catalyst.

16:57.210 --> 16:59.520
Now fall in line and support me.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.720
The Rose Sign?

17:05.820 --> 17:07.280
You're kidding.

17:07.910 --> 17:09.710
My regeneration can't keep up.

17:11.520 --> 17:13.510
I'll be stopping that sword of yours.

17:13.510 --> 17:15.930
More!

17:25.040 --> 17:30.310
I didn't expect to find spells I was 
unaware of among the people of this world.

17:30.310 --> 17:32.710
I'm surprised, too.

17:32.710 --> 17:36.660
I can't believe we still haven't defeated 
the first demon commander after all this.

17:36.930 --> 17:41.360
Don't worry. I am the 
strongest demon in battle.

17:41.580 --> 17:43.570
That's good news.

17:43.570 --> 17:47.450
If we can defeat you, 
we'll make tremendous progress!

17:47.450 --> 17:48.990
Don't let your guard down.

17:50.180 --> 17:53.010
Yeah, you wouldn't want to do that!

17:57.060 --> 17:57.770
Gotcha!

17:59.400 --> 18:04.610
Impressive. I didn't think I'd get to 
use my full strength in this battle.

18:09.290 --> 18:10.390
Get back, both of you!

18:10.810 --> 18:15.120
You're kidding, right? 
This is just the second phase?

18:16.460 --> 18:19.070
I'm sorry, but it's not a joke.

18:21.090 --> 18:22.910
Woody!

18:29.380 --> 18:30.830
Wh-What?

18:30.830 --> 18:33.630
We need to move at high speed. 
Chiya, assist me.

18:33.630 --> 18:34.680
What? But...

18:34.680 --> 18:37.500
Wait! Naval is still fighting!

18:43.850 --> 18:46.990
Woody, stop your spell! Stop!

18:46.990 --> 18:47.760
Don't!

18:48.820 --> 18:51.460
Stop it! Let me go!

18:51.460 --> 18:54.790
Hibiki, the Rose Sign Naval was using...

18:54.790 --> 19:00.270
It grants power beyond your limits 
at the cost of the user's life.

19:02.570 --> 19:03.980
Her life?

19:06.000 --> 19:09.590
It doesn't look like you 
can fight any longer.

19:09.590 --> 19:12.790
I'll be going after the hero now.

19:12.790 --> 19:14.290
I won't let you.

19:15.020 --> 19:19.240
I haven't given everything yet.

19:20.540 --> 19:25.010
A woman who only had a place killing 
her enemies on the battlefield

19:25.010 --> 19:29.520
found companions like family and a friend 
she could trust to watch her back.

19:30.180 --> 19:35.190
Either way, her destiny was to cruelly 
and worthlessly die on the battlefield!

19:35.590 --> 19:40.950
I, Naval Polar, will decide where 
I die, gain meaning for my death,

19:41.390 --> 19:44.660
and more than anything, remain in
 the memories of my friends.

19:45.650 --> 19:49.790
Such a glorious moment is 
wasted on this sword ogre!

19:49.790 --> 19:51.660
So you're prepared to die!

19:54.750 --> 19:56.180
Death Reward.

19:57.210 --> 19:59.210
Come, flames of death.

20:01.180 --> 20:02.670
What's this?!

20:04.340 --> 20:06.900
Hibiki, I had fun.

20:12.190 --> 20:13.280
No...

20:14.410 --> 20:15.600
Naval...

20:18.810 --> 20:21.910
Naval!

20:22.880 --> 20:27.140
Maybe I should've fought alongside 
the Hero of Limia, too.

20:27.140 --> 20:29.710
No. You made the right choice.

20:31.990 --> 20:37.350
Your continued existence gives 
hope to the people of Gritonia.

20:37.350 --> 20:39.000
R-Right.

20:40.520 --> 20:42.840
I'll get stronger...

20:43.530 --> 20:47.920
so I can fight without relying 
on the goddess's protection.

20:47.920 --> 20:48.420
Yes.

20:49.250 --> 20:53.460
I shall remain by your side 
and do as you wish of me.

20:54.770 --> 20:57.220
Get up already.

20:57.220 --> 20:59.860
I've still got to mend the pit.

21:03.740 --> 21:06.310
How dare that bitch...

21:06.910 --> 21:11.220
Naval, was it? I'll remember that name.

21:11.220 --> 21:13.540
More importantly, Sofia's been killed.

21:13.910 --> 21:16.660
What? The Dragon Slayer?

21:17.150 --> 21:19.430
It was that column of the goddess's light.

21:19.960 --> 21:23.580
I wonder what kind of monster she summoned.

21:24.170 --> 21:25.480
Young Master!

21:26.090 --> 21:26.870
Mio.

21:26.870 --> 21:31.370
You'll lose your arm 
regenerating him like that.

21:31.920 --> 21:33.420
I don't care!

21:33.420 --> 21:36.570
I don't care what happens to me.

21:36.570 --> 21:37.440
Mio...

21:38.360 --> 21:41.970
<i>Meanwhile, unbeknownst to Misumi Makoto,</i>

21:41.970 --> 21:44.350
<i>the heroes had ended their battle,</i>

21:45.390 --> 21:48.540
